<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">

<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Redes de Computadores - Material Interativo</title>


<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">


<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css">


<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/aos@2.3.4/dist/aos.css" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background-color: #f0f2f5; }

/* HERO */
.hero { height: 100vh; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#0d6efd,#00c6ff); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: white; text-align: center; }
.hero h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 700; text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
.hero p { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 15px; }
.btn-hero { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 1.2rem; padding: 10px 25px; border-radius: 50px; transition: all 0.3s; }
.btn-hero:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }

section { padding: 100px 0; }

/* Flip Cards */
.flip-card { background-color: transparent; perspective: 1000px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
.flip-card-inner { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 250px; text-align: center; transition: transform 0.8s; transform-style: preserve-3d; }
.flip-card:hover .flip-card-inner { transform: rotateY(180deg); }
.flip-card-front, .flip-card-back { position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 15px; backface-visibility: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; color: white; }
.flip-card-front { background-color: #0d6efd; }
.flip-card-back { background-color: #198754; transform: rotateY(180deg); }
.flip-card h4 { font-size: 1.5rem; }

/* OSI Cards */
.osi-card { border-radius: 15px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; transition: transform 0.3s; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }
.osi-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); }
.osi-card i { font-size: 3rem; color: #0d6efd; margin-bottom: 10px; }

/* Footer */
footer { background:#212529; color:white; padding:40px 0; text-align:center; }
footer a { color:white; margin:0 10px; font-size:1.4rem; }

.navbar .nav-link.active { font-weight: bold; color: #0d6efd !important; }
</style>
</head>

<body data-bs-spy="scroll" data-bs-target="#menu" data-bs-offset="70" tabindex="0">


<nav id="menu" class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark shadow sticky-top">
  <div class="container">
    <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill"></i> Redes</a>
    <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navContent">
      <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
    </button>
    <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navContent">
      <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="#inicio"><i class="bi bi-house-fill"></i> Início</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#tipos"><i class="bi bi-diagram-2-fill"></i> Tipos de Rede</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#osi"><i class="bi bi-layers-fill"></i> Modelo OSI</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#avaliacao"><i class="bi bi-chat-dots-fill"></i> Avaliação</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>


<section id="inicio" class="hero">
  <div data-aos="fade-down">
    <h1><i class="bi bi-cpu-fill"></i> Redes de Computadores</h1>
    <p class="lead">Aprenda conceitos essenciais de forma interativa e moderna</p>
    <a href="#tipos" class="btn btn-light btn-hero"><i class="bi bi-arrow-down-circle"></i> Começar estudo</a>
  </div>
</section>


<section id="tipos">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up"><i class="bi bi-diagram-2-fill"></i> Tipos de Redes</h2>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-4" data-aos="flip-left">
        <div class="flip-card">
          <div class="flip-card-inner">
            <div class="flip-card-front">
              <h4><i class="bi bi-house-fill"></i> LAN</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="flip-card-back">
              <p>Rede local, geralmente utilizada em casas ou pequenas empresas para compartilhamento de dados.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4" data-aos="flip-left" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div class="flip-card">
          <div class="flip-card-inner">
            <div class="flip-card-front">
              <h4><i class="bi bi-building"></i> MAN</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="flip-card-back">
              <p>Rede metropolitana, cobre uma cidade ou região ampla, conectando várias redes locais.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4" data-aos="flip-left" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div class="flip-card">
          <div class="flip-card-inner">
            <div class="flip-card-front">
              <h4><i class="bi bi-globe"></i> WAN</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="flip-card-back">
              <p>Rede de longa distância, como a Internet, conectando computadores ao redor do mundo.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section id="osi" class="bg-light">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up"><i class="bi bi-layers-fill"></i> Modelo OSI</h2>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-3" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="Transmissão de bits">
        <div class="osi-card" data-aos="fade-up">
          <i class="bi bi-plug-fill"></i>
          <h5>Física</h5>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="Controle de erros">
        <div class="osi-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i>
          <h5>Enlace</h5>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="Roteamento">
        <div class="osi-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <i class="bi bi-compass-fill"></i>
          <h5>Rede</h5>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="Entrega de dados">
        <div class="osi-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
          <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i>
          <h5>Transporte</h5>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4 mt-4">
      <div class="col-md-3" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" title="Controle de sessões">
        <div class="osi-card" data-aos="fade-up">
          <i class="bi bi-hammer"></i>
          <h5>Sessão</h5>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" title="Formatação de dados">
        <div class="osi-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text"></i>
          <h5>Apresentação</h5>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" title="Interface com usuário">
        <div class="osi-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <i class="bi bi-person-circle"></i>
          <h5>Aplicação</h5>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="avaliacao">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up"><i class="bi bi-chat-dots-fill"></i> Avaliação</h2>
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-md-6" data-aos="zoom-in">
        <div class="card shadow-lg p-4">
          <form>
            <div class="mb-3">
              <label class="form-label"><i class="bi bi-person"></i> Nome</label>
              <input type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="Digite seu nome" required>
            </div>
            <label class="form-label">O conteúdo foi claro?</label>
            <div class="form-check">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="avaliacao" required>
              <label class="form-check-label">Sim</label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-check">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="avaliacao" required>
              <label class="form-check-label">Não</label>
            </div>
            <br>
            <button class="btn btn-primary w-100"><i class="bi bi-send-fill"></i> Enviar avaliação</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<footer data-aos="fade-up">
  <div class="container">
    <p><i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill"></i> Material de Estudo - Redes de Computadores | 2026</p>
    <div>
      <a href="#"><i class="bi bi-facebook"></i></a>
      <a href="#"><i class="bi bi-twitter"></i></a>
      <a href="#"><i class="bi bi-instagram"></i></a>
      <a href="#"><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>


<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>

<!-- AOS JS -->
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/aos@2.3.4/dist/aos.js"></script>
<script>
AOS.init({duration:1000, once:true});
var tooltipTriggerList = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-bs-toggle="tooltip"]'));
var tooltipList = tooltipTriggerList.map(function(el){ return new bootstrap.Tooltip(el); });
</script>

</body>
</html>
